# llvm-tools payload: the compiler-toolchain binaries + opt-viewer.
# Enumerated from the published llvm-22.1.8-r3 manifest (apk info -L):
# every usr/bin entry the ninja install stages, plus usr/share/opt-viewer.
# The runtime hypervisor never installs this: mesa/virgl need only
# libLLVM.so.22.1 (DT_NEEDED-proven 2026-10-23); clang/mesa/bindgen/
# compiler-rt builds reach the tools through llvm-dev's depends_dev pin.
